  "details": "When I am using Main Menu while sitting in the VRCStation, moving left stick make me exit the station and close Main Menu.\n\nUsually, when using MainMenu, stick input is blocked and only used for scrolling.\n\nTherefore, it was completely unintended behavior for me that the left stick input causes exiting station and closing Main Menu.\n\nI confirmed this in PCVR, but I think it should occur in other environments.",
